### Crear aviso de mantenimiento por fecha (noticeId null = crear) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/saveNoticeByDate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": null,
  "unitId": 1,
  "notificationEmails": "taller@ejemplo.com;supervisor@ejemplo.com",
  "interval": 90,
  "nextEvent": "2026-09-15T08:00:00",
  "message": "Cambio de aceite trimestral",
  "noticeTypeId2": 1
}

### Actualizar aviso existente (noticeId con valor) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/saveNoticeByDate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": 1,
  "unitId": 1,
  "notificationEmails": "taller@ejemplo.com",
  "interval": 180,
  "nextEvent": "2026-12-15T08:00:00",
  "message": "Cambio de aceite semestral (actualizado)",
  "noticeTypeId2": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/saveNoticeByDate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": null,
  "unitId": 1,
  "notificationEmails": "taller@ejemplo.com",
  "interval": 90,
  "nextEvent": "2026-09-15T08:00:00",
  "message": "Cambio de aceite trimestral",
  "noticeTypeId2": 1
}

### Validación: nextEvent con fecha inválida → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Maintenance/saveNoticeByDate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noticeId": null,
  "unitId": 1,
  "notificationEmails": "taller@ejemplo.com",
  "interval": 90,
  "nextEvent": "fecha-invalida",
  "message": "Cambio de aceite trimestral",
  "noticeTypeId2": 1
}
